ve had some recent official releases you may have missed with the <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/273275/Scarred-Lands-Spell-Cards-5e?affiliate_rem=387228\" target=\"_blank\"><i><b>Spell Cards</b></i></a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/252329/Scarred-Lands-DM-Screen-5e?affiliate_rem=387228\" target=\"_blank\"><i><b>GM Screen</b></i></a>, and the <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/279098/Blood-Sea-the-Crimson-Abyss-5e?affiliate_rem=387228\" target=\"_blank\"><i><b>Blood Sea 5e</b></i></a> book, and are currently hard at work on two new sourcebooks: <i><b>Yugman's Guide to Ghelspad </b></i>and <i><b>Vigil Watch</b></i>, which we will be talking about more soon!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/They<br /> Moderator<br /> Line Developer: <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25411-travislegge","name":"TravisLegge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25411_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}